  "instructions": [
    "first, preheat a non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
    "then, toast the bread slices for about 2 minutes on each side until lightly browned.",
    "next, in a small bowl, mix the bhuna chutney, garlic, and rice vinegar.",
    "brush the chutney mixture onto toasted bread slices.",
    "top each bread slice with a quarter cup of parsley and basil leaves.",
    "drizzle a tablespoon of extra virgin olive oil over the herbs.",
    "season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "finally, serve immediately in copper mugs for a nostalgic italian flair."
  ],
